# --- Runtime data ---
# These are generated per-machine. Paths in the DB are stored by name (not
# absolute), so the app is portable even if you DO commit them — but committing
# a binary SQLite DB tends to cause merge conflicts. Uncomment to keep each
# machine's data local instead:
# app.db
# uploads/
# recordings/